            },
            "description": "Existing profile-driven opener: fetches sender + target profiles and target posts via Unipile, LLM-selects companies from the target's profile, resolves them against the org chart autocomplete, then composes the message. Requires the sender's LinkedIn profile to be synced (or session mode)."
