            "description": "Generates 3 comment variants for the person's latest post (last 30 days preferred): value-add first, with at most one variant lightly redirecting to org-chart value relevant to their ICP. Alternatively pass postId (fetches that post) or postText (no Unipile calls). Stores the post id + first comment in collection variables for the send request."
